                      <SHORT-NAME>LSduRVersionInfoApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If true the LSduR_GetVersionInfo API is available.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                      </DESC>
